Notice a little bit of an imbalance here. 11 goes to 18, 0 goes to 39.

565
00:33:18,350 --> 00:33:21,450
又一处失衡：39对1，29对71
Again, another little imbalance: 39 to 1, 29, 15 to 71.

566
00:33:21,590 --> 00:33:24,850
所以，这就是主动交易的起始过程
So, that was the beginning process of initiative being taken.

567
00:33:24,850 --> 00:33:27,490
现在，这又是一个线索
Now, again, this is our clue.

568
00:33:28,590 --> 00:33:32,210
我们的执行点可能出现在这里，能获取流动性的地方
Our execution will probably take place somewhere in here where we can get liquidity away.

570
00:33:32,750 --> 00:33:35,010
我们想在突破前入场
And we want to be in ahead of the break.

571
00:33:35,070 --> 00:33:37,310
突破就发生在这里
And this is where the break occurs.

572
00:33:37,330 --> 00:33:40,270
所以，我们能看到突破发生在92.5上方
So, we can see the break occurs just above that 92.5.

573
00:33:40,850 --> 00:33:44,010
注意突破时大量止损被触发，以及后续走势
Notice a whole bunch of stops on the break and continuation.

575
00:33:44,350 --> 00:33:48,530
另外，注意成交量、Delta以及日内Delta都在放大
Also, notice the volume pick-up as well as the delta and the delta on the day.

577
00:33:49,450 --> 00:33:50,930
所以，这是我们的第二个线索
So, that’s our second clue.

578
00:33:50,930 --> 00:33:55,250
我知道有时看起来简单，但它确实就是这么简单
And again, I know it sometimes seems easy, but it is that easy, guys.

580
00:33:55,270 --> 00:33:58,848
你只需要学会观察市场给出的线索而不是试图预测，或是自我怀疑
You just have to learn to observe the clues from the markets

581
00:33:58,848 --> 00:34:02,128
rather than trying to anticipate, rather than trying to second-guess yourself.

583
00:34:02,130 --> 00:34:03,710
你只是在等那个线索
You’re simply waiting for that clue.

584
00:34:04,070 --> 00:34:06,330
线索一出现，立即执行
Bang! When that clue’s in, you execute.

585
00:34:06,970 --> 00:34:11,770
现在，我们再看一个例子
Now, what we’re going to do, we’re going to have a look at one more example.

587
00:34:12,110 --> 00:34:14,550
这是12月5日黄金市场的案例
This is now in gold again on the 5th of December.

589
00:34:14,830 --> 00:34:16,050
同样是5分钟周期
Again, a five-minute rotation.

590
00:34:16,710 --> 00:34:18,090
这是第二种策略
Now, this is the second strategy.

591
00:34:18,170 --> 00:34:20,810
显然，我们已经讲过两种执行方式
Obviously, we’ve spoken about the two types of execution.

593
00:34:20,930 --> 00:34:23,270
第一种是在突破前的线索上
One is on the clue ahead of the break.

594
00:34:23,410 --> 00:34:24,850
我们想在突破时入场
We want to be in on the break.

595
00:34:25,170 --> 00:34:30,910
第二点，突破后的首次回撤。我们已确认一个有效突破
The second is, once we’ve had a breakout, the first pullback. We’ve identified a good breakout.

597
00:34:31,030 --> 00:34:32,370
然后等待首次回调
We wait for that first pullback.

598
00:34:32,890 --> 00:34:38,190
你会发现市场形成了明显的衰竭低点
And we can see, very simply, the market has a nice exhaustion low.

600
00:34:38,190 --> 00:34:40,070
之前单元我们已经讲过
We’ve spoken about those in previous units.

601
00:34:40,490 --> 00:34:42,677
市场试图喘口气
It tries to take a breather.

602
00:34:42,677 --> 00:34:48,509
回落并测试之前的流动性密集区或高点
Comes back and tests a pocket positioning or high area of liquidity that was previously provided.

604
00:34:49,090 --> 00:34:58,130
不止一次，而是两三次后继续下行
And holds that point as resistance, not just once, but twice and three times before continuing low.

606
00:34:58,130 --> 00:35:01,090
即首次回调
So, that would be our second entry point, which would be that first pullback.

608
00:35:01,390 --> 00:35:05,470
这是经验法则
Now, note what I would say. What is very different. This is a rule of thumb.

610
00:35:05,470 --> 00:35:12,704
我要你抛开其他所有理解比如衰竭高点和低点
With a breakout, what I want you to do is get rid of all other understanding

611
00:35:12,704 --> 00:35:15,868
of exhaustion lows and highs, for instance.

613
00:35:16,330 --> 00:35:19,850
因为，我之前也说过，每个交易策略都必须有上下文
Because, as I’ve said to you, every one of these trade strategies has to have some form of context.

616
00:35:19,970 --> 00:35:24,610
突破交易策略本质上就是价格发现
A breakout trade strategy, by definition, is all about price discovery.

618
00:35:25,170 --> 00:35:32,190
这不是一次性事件
When a market goes into price discovery, it’s not a one-off feature.

620
00:35:32,210 --> 00:35:36,350
然后停止再回落
It’s not like we break, pull back, and then stop and come back down.

622
00:35:36,930 --> 00:35:39,110
如果这样，就是支撑或阻力失效
If that happens, we have a failed support or resistance.

623
00:35:39,750 --> 00:35:45,918
突破后会回调继续延伸并持续价格发现的进程价格发现的功能
But more often than not, a breakout, we have the break, we pull back,

624
00:35:45,918 --> 00:35:50,764
and we're more than likely—very high probability—and always extend

625
00:35:50,764 --> 00:35:53,848
and continue the function of price discovery.

628
00:35:56,350 --> 00:35:57,470
这就是关键
And that’s the key, guys.

629
00:35:57,470 --> 00:36:01,462
知道有效突破总会引发价格发现赚一笔因为你已掌握这个原理
If you know that, if you know breakouts, good breakouts will always form

630
00:36:01,462 --> 00:36:05,761
some form of price discovery, you can execute once, early ahead of the break,

631
00:36:05,761 --> 00:36:10,367
make good money, take your profits on the exhaustion, because you’ve learned that principle.

635
00:36:10,950 --> 00:36:15,250
然后持有等待第二波延伸
Sell the first pullback, okay, and hold on for the second extension.

637
00:36:15,510 --> 00:36:17,330
一个策略，两次交易
Two trades, one strategy.

638
00:36:18,030 --> 00:36:20,830
现在看个例子
Okay. Now, let’s take a look at one of the examples.

640
00:36:21,910 --> 00:36:31,150
第一个例子来自黄金，日期是11月27日
The first example we’re going to look at will be from gold. This is on the 27th of November.

642
00:36:32,870 --> 00:36:35,436
这就是我之前在白板上给你展示的突破
This is the breakout I was showing you on the board.

643
00:36:35,436 --> 00:36:39,869
现在快进到这个点，看看具体情况。
Now, I’m just going to fast-forward it to that point so you can see what it looks like.

644
00:36:40,570 --> 00:36:44,390
163手。我们只需要关注这个线索。
163 lots. So, all we’re really going to focus on is this clue being provided.

646
00:36:44,810 --> 00:36:50,470
再次注意市场变化。几乎没有成交，成交量极低。
Again, like I said, note the variations. Nothing really going through the market. Really, really light in terms of volume.

648
00:36:51,050 --> 00:36:54,650
市场上动静不大。可以看到价格在下跌。
