突然，有人开始抛售。
And all of a sudden, we start to see someone selling.

650
00:36:59,890 --> 00:37:05,170
但同时，有人在重新挂买价。这就是多头承接盘。
But equally, someone reloading the bid. Okay. And this is what we call absorption of the buyers.

651
00:37:06,850 --> 00:37:08,970
注意它出现的位置。这一点非常关键。
Alright. And note where it's coming. It's so important.

652
00:37:09,230 --> 00:37:13,230
多头承接盘必须出现在极端点。也就是说，在突破前。
The absorption of the buyers needs to come at the extreme point. In other words, ahead of the break.

654
00:37:13,270 --> 00:37:15,970
我们不希望在K线图下方看到它。
We don't want to see it down here on the candlestick chart. Okay. We don't want to see it

656
00:37:15,970 --> 00:37:19,270
也不希望在盘整区或分销区的底部看到。
at the base of the consolidation area or distribution area.

657
00:37:19,470 --> 00:37:24,130
我们希望它出现在高位附近。就在突破前。这才是真正的线索。
We want to see it towards the high end. Just ahead of the breakout. And that's our real clue.

659
00:37:24,470 --> 00:37:26,490
可以看到，多头承接盘确实在发生。
Okay. So, we can see real absorption of the buyers going through.

660
00:37:26,890 --> 00:37:28,430
Delta也在上升。
We can see the Delta picking up.

661
00:37:29,230 --> 00:37:32,470
当市场停止向他抛售时，注意发生了什么。
The moment the market stops selling to him, note what’s happened.

662
00:37:32,590 --> 00:37:37,530
一旦抛售暂停，价格立刻被拉升。
So, notice once that pauses, there it pauses. Straight away, what happens? Bid up.

664
00:37:38,950 --> 00:37:42,210
市场立即意识到有人在重新挂买价。
Straight away, the market’s realized that someone is sitting there reloading.

665
00:37:43,570 --> 00:37:48,470
显然，市场随即做出反应。买价被推高。
And obviously, all of a sudden, the market responds in kind. So, we get the bid up.

667
00:37:49,870 --> 00:37:52,010
接着，我们看到一些主动买盘出现。
Straight away, we see a little bit of initiative coming in.

668
00:37:55,150 --> 00:38:00,910
然后市场决定突破并继续上涨。
And the market then suddenly decides to take the break and continue higher.

670
00:38:00,970 --> 00:38:06,150
现在可以看到，黄金市场日线图上出现小双顶。
Now, again, as you can see, a little bit of a double top on the dailies in the gold market.

672
00:38:06,710 --> 00:38:09,350
再次注意成交量的变化。这一点非常关键。
Again, notice the volume shift here. This is really key.

673
00:38:09,370 --> 00:38:11,490
看看多头如何改变意图。
Look how the buyers are shifting their intentions.

674
00:38:11,670 --> 00:38:14,030
之前的波动中没有深蓝色。
Okay. No dark blues in any one of the previous rotations.

675
00:38:14,730 --> 00:38:16,220
突然出现大量深蓝色。
Suddenly, a lot of dark blue.

676
00:38:16,220 --> 00:38:16,965
没有抛售。
No selling. Okay.

677
00:38:21,270 --> 00:38:24,570
注意在当日最高价处的重新挂买价。
Only aggressive buying. Again, notice the reload at the highest price of the day.

678
00:38:19,696 --> 00:38:20,689
没有抛售出现。
No selling coming in.

679
00:38:25,270 --> 00:38:27,890
92价位处有非常激进的重新挂买价。
Okay. Really aggressive reload there at 92s.

680
00:38:28,850 --> 00:38:30,250
价格立刻回到买价。
Straight away, back on the bid.

681
00:38:30,710 --> 00:38:33,910
在129价位以最佳价格买入市场。
Buying the market at the best price available: 129.

682
00:38:34,310 --> 00:38:37,990
随即上涨至下一个最佳价格71，无卖单进场
Straight away up to the next best price, 71. No selling coming in.

683
00:38:38,250 --> 00:38:43,890
突然，市场会向上惊慌并触发止损
And all of a sudden, we're going to see the market panic to the upside and take some stops.

685
00:38:45,370 --> 00:38:48,350
现在看执行层面
Okay. Now, note, in terms of execution,

686
00:38:48,650 --> 00:38:56,230
显然我们希望在吸收发生时入场
we obviously do want to get in when this absorption is taking place. If we're not in, again,

688
00:38:56,250 --> 00:38:58,963
你可能在1手附近成交
you might be able to get a fill around that one lot.

689
00:38:58,963 --> 00:39:01,449
但要记住，你会受制于卖家
But remember, you are then at the mercy of a seller.

691
00:39:01,450 --> 00:39:05,090
可以看到卖单确实很少
We could see there’s really a real lack of selling coming in.

692
00:39:05,090 --> 00:39:08,450
但等待只会增加交易风险
So, by waiting, you're simply adding to the risk of your trade.

694
00:39:08,630 --> 00:39:14,990
注意158手——买方订单非常激进，出现在当日高点
Again, note the 158 lots—quite an aggressive amount of buy-side order. Where? At the high of the day. Okay.

696
00:39:14,990 --> 00:39:15,970
这就是动态的转变
That’s the shift in dynamics.

697
00:39:16,030 --> 00:39:21,710
这是真正的信号，局势已变突破即将发生
That’s the real clue that something has shifted and the breakout is about to occur.

699
00:39:26,030 --> 00:39:27,530
我们能抵达突破点
We can get to that breakout point.

700
00:39:29,290 --> 00:39:31,290
现在退一步看
And let’s just take that one step back.

701
00:39:33,150 --> 00:39:37,770
再观察20秒，然后进入下个案例
Okay. So, we're just going to watch this for another 20 seconds, and then we'll move on to our next example.

