00:39:37,770 --> 00:39:42,850
可以看到一些卖盘介入。价格是92。
So, again, we can see a little bit of selling step in. Okay. So, a little bit of selling: 92s.

706
00:39:42,950 --> 00:39:43,550
记得我们之前说的
