如果够幸运理想入场点是主动买盘进场的位置那种非常激进的买盘
If we do get fortunate enough,

708
00:39:45,056 --> 00:39:48,276
we ideally want to get in where any one of that really aggressive,

709
00:39:48,276 --> 00:39:49,266
intentional buying stepped in.

