在129和71都出现过
We saw it both at the 129 but also the 71.

711
00:39:52,670 --> 00:39:56,030
价格确实回落，给了你21手成交的机会
It did come down and give you a chance. It gave you 21 lots filled.

713
00:39:56,950 --> 00:39:58,010
随即又反弹向上
Straight away back but up.

714
00:39:59,410 --> 00:40:04,770
如果你盯着价格梯队，会发现市场非常激进，一路涨到1295。
Again, if you're watching the price ladder, you can see the market very aggressive, moved up all the way to 1295.

717
00:40:05,050 --> 00:40:09,450
从92到1295，真正的30-40个Tick上涨
So, a real 30–40-tick move in the market from, what, 92s.

719
00:40:09,490 --> 00:40:13,570
你可能在92到95之间买入
I mean, you would have been buying somewhere around 92s up to 95.

721
00:40:13,730 --> 00:40:18,050
黄金30个Tick的涨幅，标志着突破
So, a good 30-tick move in gold and that signals the breakout.

723
00:40:19,430 --> 00:40:21,330
现在进入下一个案例
Now, let’s move on to our next example.

724
00:40:21,770 --> 00:40:23,870
这是英镑的突破交易
This is going to be a breakout in cable.

725
00:40:24,150 --> 00:40:25,510
注意，这是中区间行情
Again, remember this is mid-range.

726
00:40:25,510 --> 00:40:28,310
所以你能看出这有多关键，因为我想给你看看。
So, you can see why this is crucial, because I want to show you.

728
00:40:28,370 --> 00:40:32,130
我想打破一个误区：突破交易只发生在极端点。
I want to dispel the idea that breakouts occur just in extremes.

730
00:40:32,210 --> 00:40:34,870
其实不是。突破可能发生在任何位置。
They don’t. They can occur from anywhere.

731
00:40:35,090 --> 00:40:41,730
你总是要做分析。
And that’s why we have clues like price velocity shifting—so important. You always do analysis.

733
00:40:41,870 --> 00:40:45,010
价格速度变化时，你只需执行交易。
You always have those blue lines, so that when velocity shifts, you can simply execute.

736
00:40:50,530 --> 00:40:52,770
现在你会看到，英镑/美元处于一个相对横盘区间。
What you’re going to see now is cable sitting in a relatively sideways range.

738
00:40:52,770 --> 00:41:00,090
没有什么动静——成交量低，颜色浅，Delta几乎零变化。
Nothing going on—low volume, light colors, zero change in delta.

739
00:41:00,610 --> 00:41:02,790
但当天的Delta是负的。
We do, however, have a negative delta on the day.

740
00:41:02,850 --> 00:41:04,350
所以，当天的Delta确实偏负。
So, there’s quite a negative delta on the day.

741
00:41:04,650 --> 00:41:08,810
但价格却靠近当天最高点，这很有趣。
But prices are sitting quite close to the high of the day, which is quite fascinating.

743
00:41:08,890 --> 00:41:09,990
现在，注意这里刚发生了什么。
Now, note what’s just happened here.

744
00:41:10,850 --> 00:41:17,190
市场立刻上涨，我们看到一个相当激进的买家。
Straight away, the market’s come up and we’ve seen a relatively aggressive buyer.

746
00:41:17,370 --> 00:41:20,470
这是一个微妙的线索，因为这里有了变化。
This is a real subtle clue because something’s changed here.

747
00:41:20,470 --> 00:41:22,890
如果我现在看到这个，会高度警惕。
Now, if I just saw this now, I’d be really switched on.

749
00:41:22,970 --> 00:41:24,250
这并不意味着必须买入或卖出。
It doesn’t necessarily mean to buy or sell.

750
00:41:24,570 --> 00:41:26,324
但某种变化发生了，因为突然我们看到一个买家不仅接下200手合约，还额外买入了123手。
But something’s changed because suddenly

