753
00:41:30,750 --> 00:41:33,270
这是买家非常激进的意图。
So, really aggressive intent taken from a buyer.

754
00:41:33,970 --> 00:41:35,230
看看价格怎么走。
Watch what happens to price.

755
00:41:35,610 --> 00:41:36,950
它朝反方向运动了。
It goes in the opposite direction.

756
00:41:37,790 --> 00:41:39,230
那就是我们的微妙线索。
That was our subtle clue.

757
00:41:39,290 --> 00:41:41,870
