Now, you’re going to see how this plays out over the next couple of minutes.

759
00:41:43,650 --> 00:41:47,450
最终，我们开始看到在这个波动中形成一点失衡。
Ultimately, we start to see a little bit of an imbalance form in the middle of this rotation.

761
00:41:47,450 --> 00:41:49,710
这些显然是5分钟的波动。
Now, these are obviously five-minute rotations.

762
00:41:50,990 --> 00:41:59,810
突然，市场开始逐步下跌。
And suddenly, we start to see the market move slightly lower and lower and lower.

764
00:42:00,950 --> 00:42:03,350
我们很早就收到了信号。
We got the signal early on.

765
00:42:04,410 --> 00:42:10,730
突然，市场开始朝反方向发起主动行动。再看看失衡。
And all of a sudden, the market begins the process of initiative in the opposite direction. Note the imbalances again.

767
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:14,410
高位有失衡，低位也有失衡。
We had imbalances higher up, imbalances lower down.

769
00:42:16,090 --> 00:42:22,770
突然，市场开始快速回撤。
And suddenly, the market begins a very rapid process of unwind.

771
00:42:22,950 --> 00:42:24,590
现在回到那个突破点
Okay, I just want to get back to that break point.

772
00:42:24,870 --> 00:42:26,210
再强调一次
So, again, just note, guys.

773
00:42:26,330 --> 00:42:30,950
突破交易并不总是突然大幅上涨
It’s not always that a breakout is going to be suddenly huge or big.

775
00:42:31,050 --> 00:42:33,350
显然，我们看到了一个小的外侧K线
Okay. Obviously, note we did have a little bit of an outside candle.

777
00:42:33,650 --> 00:42:35,230
注意成交量的变化
Okay. Note the change in volume.

778
00:42:35,330 --> 00:42:36,370
注意Delta的转变
Note the shift in delta.

779
